flowchart TB
  accTitle: Spectra maintenance: application update, explicit project migration and doctor, with preservation boundaries
  accDescr: Update changes only the application installed on the machine and never reads or writes a project; migrate is a separate, explicit command that checks and then migrates one project. Uninstall is also machine-only. Doctor reports health without writes; doctor --fix refreshes generated project assets and repairs missing adapters only when safe. Preserved information is a boundary, not a subsequent action. Explicit adapter regeneration is a separate user command. Groups M1 to M4 have matching HTML explanations.
  subgraph MAINT_UPDATE["M1 · Update the application, migrate a project"]
    direction TB
    subgraph MACHINE["Machine lifecycle"]
      direction LR
      UPDATE["spectra update<br/>Update this machine"]
      NATIVE["Managed native<br/>Runtime only"]
      OTHER["Other installs<br/>Guidance only"]
      UNINSTALL["spectra uninstall<br/>Remove native app"]
      UPDATE -->|managed native| NATIVE
      UPDATE -.->|npm, npx| OTHER
      NATIVE ~~~ UNINSTALL
    end
    NOTE["update ≠ migrate<br/>Update never touches a project"]
    subgraph PROJECT["Project lifecycle"]
      direction LR
      CHECK["migrate --check<br/>Check migration"]
      APPLY["migrate --yes<br/>Migrate this project"]
      CHECK -->|explicit migration| APPLY
    end
    MACHINE ~~~ NOTE
    NOTE ~~~ PROJECT
  end
  subgraph MAINT_DOCTOR["M2 · Inspect or repair local health"]
    direction LR
    DOCTOR["spectra doctor<br/>Inspect only"]
    FIX["doctor --fix<br/>Refresh assets"]
    SAFE["Adapters safe?<br/>Tool and set present"]
    ADAPTER_REPAIR["Adapters fixed<br/>Missing files"]
    MANUAL["Reported<br/>Unsafe skipped"]
    DOCTOR -.->|--fix| FIX
    FIX -->|then| SAFE
    SAFE -.->|yes| ADAPTER_REPAIR
    SAFE -->|no| MANUAL
  end
  subgraph MAINT_PRESERVED["M3 · Preserved project information"]
    direction LR
    KEEP["Preserved on refresh and repair<br/>Memory, features, governance<br/>Plugin docs, user adapters"]
  end
  subgraph MAINT_ADAPTERS["M4 · Explicit adapter regeneration"]
    direction LR
    HEALTHY["Healthy adapters?<br/>Update skips them"]
    ADAPTERS["spectra adapters<br/>Regenerate on request"]
    HEALTHY -.->|only on request| ADAPTERS
  end
  %% Invisible links control layout only; these groups are not sequential steps.
  MAINT_UPDATE ~~~ MAINT_DOCTOR
  MAINT_DOCTOR ~~~ MAINT_PRESERVED
  MAINT_PRESERVED ~~~ MAINT_ADAPTERS
